Try this: next time you get a scroll, put it in one of the "specific" slots
(boots, cloak, finger, etc.)...it will be used but not destroyed!  Handy, eh?
Here's the (trivial) patch:

*** oinv.c.orig	Sun Jul 31 15:17:43 1988
--- oinv.c	Thu Jul 28 20:31:41 1988
***************
*** 1003,1009 ****
      
      take = ((!merge) && (!slotnull) && airnull);
      
!     put = ((!merge) && slotnull && (!airnull));
      
      trade = ((!merge) && (!slotnull) && (!airnull) && slottable(oair,slot));
      
--- 1007,1013 ----
      
      take = ((!merge) && (!slotnull) && airnull);
      
!     put = ((!merge) && slotnull && (!airnull) && slottable(oair,slot));
      
      trade = ((!merge) && (!slotnull) && (!airnull) && slottable(oair,slot));

